{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1320712001:0":{"text":"Finally! Your friends said you've got a way to stop those gruglins for good.","source_cn":"哦，你可算来了！你的族人说有办法解决咕布林破坏栅栏的问...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373F96DDA1188635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320712002:1":{"text":"Ugh, those blabbermouths! I only just came up with the idea, and Haldor's already told you?","source_cn":"那帮家伙的嘴挺快啊，我才想出新点子，老约恩这就告诉你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC17DB825E5807C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320712003:1":{"text":"Anyway, meet Ironchomp. You're gonna love it!","source_cn":"我马上请小铁牙出来，你们瞧好吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB50BB6B83E05B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320712004:1":{"text":"What's an Ironchomp?","source_cn":"小铁牙？小铁牙是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF6C0D447591C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320712005:1":{"text":"It's the name of the protective fence I designed!","source_cn":"是我做的防护栅栏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1734320146FAB237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320712006:1":{"text":"That... well, you've given it quite the name.","source_cn":"这……好吧，你给它取了个好名字呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F953FA67ED12A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320712007:1":{"text":"Of course! If it works, it'll stop the gruglins cold and revolutionize Cedartown's security!","source_cn":"那可不！要是小铁牙能彻底阻止咕布林，它以后也能为雪松镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33CEA61B77D3BE9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320712008:1":{"text":"It'll take a bit to set up, though—it should be done by dawn. Why don't you keep me company?","source_cn":"安装小铁牙需要点时间，你们等等吧，不会太久的，明早天亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A90746A144DC9F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320712009:1":{"text":"Dawn tomorrow?! That's forever away!","source_cn":"这也太久了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02412EEE25E8D5E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320712010:1":{"text":"What's the rush? You got plans?","source_cn":"咋啦？你们还有事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAF1D00732FB638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1320712010":{"text":"What's the rush? You got plans?","source_cn":"咋啦？你们还有事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAF1D00732FB638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320712011:1":{"text":"Is it something urgent?","source_cn":"什么事？要紧不？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0E569FFAD9E0D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320712012:1":{"text":"Kinda... I need to pick out some gifts for everyone back home.","source_cn":"倒不是什么要紧事，我在帮家人们挑礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE824558A8985C333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320712013:1":{"text":"And I can't be out too long, there's work waiting for me at the inn.","source_cn":"可我不能在外头耽误太久，旅馆那边还有活儿等着我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA03A24BAFA35F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320712015:1":{"text":"If it's gifts you're after, you can't skip Cedartown's specialty: <style=\"highlight\">canned balm herring</style>!","source_cn":"说到礼物，千万不能错过镇子上的名产——<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9268B71A32C4B8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320712016:1":{"text":"It's the best snack with drinks you'll find. Trust me, it'll be a hit with anyone!","source_cn":"雪松镇再也找不到比它更带劲的下酒菜了，相信我，你们一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC9BE7D6EED9544","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320712017:1":{"text":"Fish, huh? Master Arden and Granny Dahnie would definitely go for that. Where do I get some?","source_cn":"下酒菜啊……雅顿老师和达赫妮婆婆应该会喜欢。哪里能买到？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFC8B7413CF412A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320712018:1":{"text":"There's this awesome spot I always go to. Tell 'em I sent you, and you might even get a little discount!","source_cn":"镇上我常去的那家餐馆就能买到。报我的名字，兴许老板娘还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9060D7E77343086C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320712019:1":{"text":"That'll be our next stop. Thanks!","source_cn":"我们马上去，谢啦老兄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7E364BC113FA2A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320712020:1":{"text":"Let's go, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE7CC7D5A123164","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's go, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"Let's go, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"146833","variant_female_record_index":"146834","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"Well... yes.","source_cn":"嗯，是有点事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD647203F471790","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well... yes.","female":"Well... yes.","variant_male_record_index":"69004","variant_female_record_index":"69005","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320712014:1":{"text":"Oho! I've got a suggestion for you!","source_cn":"礼物呀，我知道一个好东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF0C8B97F8F8286D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"We're shopping for gifts.","source_cn":"我们要去买礼物","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x24470C011286ABAB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're shopping for gifts.","female":"We're shopping for gifts.","variant_male_record_index":"69006","variant_female_record_index":"69007","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:牧羊的费多尔":{"text":"Shepherd Fedor","source":"牧羊的费多尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"Hugin","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":3}}